window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>One night.</p> <p>No names.</p> <p>A fantasy come to life.</p> <p>That's what I signed up for when I let the Queen of Corline play fairy godmother. I've spent years behind the scenes making their world beautiful. I didn't think there'd be any harm in having my own princess moment. Until I met him.</p> <p>Dashing, gorgeous, and everything I ever dreamed of, this rebel without a cause took my breath away in one night of unbridled passion.</p> <p>He also left me with a big secret I won't be able to hide for very long.</p>"; 
